<h1>Examples</h1>

<p>These pages render the <strong>literal source</strong> of the runnable
examples in the <a href="https://github.com/Startr/WEB-Startr.Team">site
repo's</a> <code>examples/</code> directory — built from the same files you
run, so they cannot drift. Each example assumes
<code>startr-team</code> is installed and an LLM is configured
(<a href="/spec/config/">Configuration</a>).</p>

{% for example in examples %}
  <h2 id="{{ example.name }}"><code>{{ example.name }}</code></h2>
  {% if example.intro %}<p>{{ example.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
  {% for file in example.files %}
    <details {% if loop.first %}open{% endif %}>
      <summary style="--p:0.5rem 0; --weight:600; --cur:pointer">{{ example.name }}/{{ file.rel }}</summary>
      <pre><code class="language-{{ file.lang }}">{{ file.content }}</code></pre>
    </details>
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

<p style="--mt:2rem">To run one: clone the site repo, <code>cd examples/&lt;name&gt;</code>,
set your environment, and <code>python run.py</code>. The
<code>review_loop</code> plan vault (<code>examples/review_loop/plans/</code>)
opens directly in Obsidian or SilverBullet — watch node status change while
the agent runs.</p>
